012109932,-0.028274545,-0.027997281,-0.024857195,0.0021222292,-0.0125949895,-0.0044345954,-0.07685811,-0.039979428,-0.049869265,-0.042294886,-0.020298703,0.029507019,0.045641262,-0.1361599,-0.023940338,-0.0142461825,0.063301034,-0.012757704,0.0033899993,0.0020225532,-0.06864864,-0.0067619877,-0.01165612,0.005815039,-0.12881176,0.011172581,-0.026744626,-0.055239953,-0.052322764,0.05247141,-0.07309142,-0.007609757,0.014224819,-0.021510553,0.027298257,-0.0548154,0.082882285,-0.020042123,0.0219108,0.041536268,0.011458814,0.065448605,0.068264306,-0.12579419,0.014125706,-0.06614874,0.08819843,0.07907672,-0.020552207,-0.02371402,0.002541107,-0.046800397,-0.023738714,-0.02932904,0.14978026,-0.049518947,-0.027906759,0.016106822]],"documents":["resume | Resume of Ramesh Das, Senior Full Stack Engineer | Resume of Ramesh Das, Senior Full Stack Engineer | RAMESH DAS  Senior Full Stack Engineer (SDE III) — Node.js | React.js | Go | AWS | GenAI & Agentic AI | Microservices | System Design  Delhi, India   |   +91 7059476213   |   rameshdas028@gmail.com   |   LinkedIn  PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY  Full Stack Engineer with   7+ years   building high-availability distributed systems on Node.js, React.js, and AWS, with hands-on experience shipping production GenAI/Agentic AI solutions (RAG pipelines, MCP servers, LLM-based automation). Track record of cutting infrastructure cost ( ~50% ) and P99 latency ( ~60% ) while scaling systems to   100K+ RPS   and multi-million-record data pipelines. Comfortable owning a system end-to-end — architecture, cloud infra, delivery, and post-launch optimization.  CORE SKILLS  Languages:   JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, Go   Frontend:   React.js, Vue.js, Redux Toolkit, Microfrontends  Backend:   Node.js, Express.js, REST & GraphQL API Design, gRPC   AI / GenAI:   LLMs, AI Agents, Agentic AI, RAG, Prompt Engineering, MCP  Architecture:   Microservices, Event-Driven, Distributed Systems, System Design  Databases:   MySQL, MongoDB, DynamoDB, Redis, Elasticsearch  Cloud & DevOps:   AWS (Solutions Architect), Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, Serverless  Monitoring:   CloudWatch, Prometheus, Grafana, Loki  PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE  Full Stack Developer   | SUTRA AI Private Limited (parent of String Ventures) — Noida, India Nov 2022 – Present  •   Built production GenAI/Agentic AI systems — RAG pipelines, MCP servers, and LLM-based agent workflows — that automate product queries, order tracking, and delivery support for   24/7 customer service .  •   Built an AI-powered document extraction pipeline (LLMs + OCR) converting unstructured documents into structured JSON, cutting manual processing effort by   90% .  •   Designed high-throughput data ingestion pipelines processing   80K–1M records , reducing processing time from ~1 hour to   under 5 minutes .  •   Optimized backend APIs, queries, and caching, cutting P90 latency from ~800ms to   ~300ms   and P99 latency from ~1.5s to  ~600ms   under high traffic.  •   Designed and implemented a distributed Redis + Lua rate limiter (atomic counters, TTL expiration) enforcing per-client throttling and eliminating API overload and Redis memory growth.  •   Architected and provisioned cloud infrastructure end-to-end (Terraform, Kubernetes, Docker, CI/CD) spanning networking, compute, IAM, load balancing, autoscaling, and monitoring; reduced AWS cost by   ~50%   with no performance trade-off.  •   Cut Docker build times by   60–90%   and manual deployment effort by   70% , enabling zero-downtime production releases.  •   Migrated Redux to Redux Toolkit, cutting boilerplate and lifting frontend state-management performance by   ~30% .  Software Developer   | Volumtree Technology Solutions Pvt. Ltd — Chandigarh, India May 2022 – Oct 2022  •   Re-architected a Salesforce data pipeline processing   ~1.5M records , cutting execut","profile photo | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket standing in front of a mossy tree trunk. | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket standing in front of a mossy tree trunk. | No text present in the image. Visual details: A young South Asian man with short black hair, trimmed beard, wearing a light grey suit jacket over a white collared shirt, arms crossed, with a red thread tied on his wrist. Background shows a forest setting with large, green, moss-covered tree trunks.","presentation banner | Blueprint-themed presentation banner titled 'ARCHITECTING THE FUTURE: CLOUD | SOLUTION | AI'. | Blueprint-themed presentation banner titled 'ARCHITECTING THE FUTURE: CLOUD | SOLUTION | AI'. | ARCHITECTING THE FUTURE\nCLOUD | SOLUTION | AI","web page screenshot | Screenshot of the footer section of the TCS iBegin candidate portal website. | Screenshot of the footer section of the TCS iBegin candidate portal website. | Chrome File Edit View History Bookmarks Profiles Tab Window Help Wed Sep 9 5:33 PM Ask Gemini ibegin.tcsapps.com/candidate/next/ TCS iBegin tcs iBegin Ramesh Das | LinkedIn Relaunch to update iBegin India Careers My Saved Jobs Guided Search tcs TATA CONSULTANCY SERVICES LEGAL Terms and Conditions Cookie Policy Privacy Notice Disclaimer Accessibility Statement CONNECT WITH US Contact Us UPDATE Subscribe to Promotional mails Unsubscribe from Promotional mails HELP FAQs f X in iBegin Release Version: 4.2.0-17-8.1.1.GA-redhat-00019 | © 2026 Tata Consultancy Services Limited | Build number: 4.2.0-17-8.1.1.GA-redhat-00019","presentation slide | Blueprint-style tech banner or presentation slide titled 'ARCHITECTING THE FUTURE: CLOUD | SOLUTION | AI'. | Blueprint-style tech banner or presentation slide titled 'ARCHITECTING THE FUTURE: CLOUD | SOLUTION | AI'. | ARCHITECTING THE FUTURE\nCLOUD | SOLUTION | AI","resume | Resume of Ramesh Das, Senior Full Stack Engineer | Resume of Ramesh Das, Senior Full Stack Engineer | RAMESH DAS  Senior Full Stack Engineer (SDE III) — Node.js | React.js | Go | AWS | GenAI & Agentic AI | Microservices | System Design  Delhi, India   |   +91 7059476213   |   ra