+ Lua rate limiter (atomic counters, TTL expiration) enforcing per-client throttling and eliminating API overload and Redis memory growth.  •   Architected and provisioned cloud infrastructure end-to-end (Terraform, Kubernetes, Docker, CI/CD) spanning networking, compute, IAM, load balancing, autoscaling, and monitoring; reduced AWS cost by   ~50%   with no performance trade-off.  •   Cut Docker build times by   60–90%   and manual deployment effort by   70% , enabling zero-downtime production releases.  •   Migrated Redux to Redux Toolkit, cutting boilerplate and lifting frontend state-management performance by   ~30% .  Software Developer   | Volumtree Technology Solutions Pvt. Ltd — Chandigarh, India May 2022 – Oct 2022  •   Re-architected a Salesforce data pipeline processing   ~1.5M records , cutting execut","passport photo | Portrait photo of a man in a grey suit with arms crossed, standing in front of a moss-covered tree trunk. | Portrait photo of a man in a grey suit with arms crossed, standing in front of a moss-covered tree trunk. | No text found in the image. Visual contents: a man with dark hair, beard, wearing a white shirt and grey suit jacket, standing in a forest setting with mossy trees.","passport photo | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket and white shirt, standing with arms crossed in front of mossy trees. | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket and white shirt, standing with arms crossed in front of mossy trees. | No text found in the image. Visual portrait of a man with dark hair and beard, wearing a grey suit, white shirt, and a red wristband, with a forest background.","passport photo | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket and white shirt, standing with arms crossed against a mossy tree trunk background. | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket and white shirt, standing with arms crossed against a mossy tree trunk background.","personal portrait | Portrait of a young man in a grey suit jacket and white shirt,